# Frontend (`frontend/`)

- Next.js App Router under `src/app/`. Use TypeScript strict mode.
- Import via `@/` path alias for `src/*`.
- Call the API with `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`; never hardcode production hosts.
- Keep UI minimal until product pages are requested. No premature design system.
- Prefer Server Components by default; add client components only when interactivity requires it.
